<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritian rupee weakens against dollar, sterling.</title>
<headline>Mauritian rupee weakens against dollar, sterling.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee weakened slightly against the dollar and pound sterling on Friday, reflecting international trends, dealers said.</p>
<p>They said the rupee was posted at a mean commercial rate of 21.844 to the dollar against 21.818 on Thursday and at 34.787 to the pound sterling against 34.608 on Thursday.</p>
</text>
